{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expansion pack #8 highlights the most important aspect of Tuggowar\u00a0\u2013 managing your arsenal, a.k.a. your deck. Mastery over what goes in and what comes out is essential, and that is exactly what you get here</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is a catch though: These cards are <strong>some of the most complex</strong> in the game thus far, and require mastery in and of themselves. Luckily, learning is half the fun!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Spring Cleaning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Divest lets you clean all the Coal from your deck in one fell swoop, in theory.<br>It's also the first card to give you <strong>Production</strong> every time you play it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880380/extras/0db9d1b584895ee40201281ba0927678.avif?t=1753171870\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">No You Don't</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want to stop those pesky Explosives? Want to finally stop that Rocketeer from touching your Creepy B? Join the Protectionist club!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880380/extras/2bf5a88496eaa9ce7465254bc8bb1181.avif?t=1753171870\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Final Version</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Update just got an update... and it's a major one. Support this and you get one of the most powerful effects in the game. This is a great investment for a reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880380/extras/ac04a12ea3a9b26fbb2e573aa3454330.avif?t=1753171870\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3880380?t=1753171870","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/stor